== a good file ==
templates: 2 from 1 file(s)
  greet {who*}
  plain

== and every way one can be wrong ==
templates: 0 from 1 file(s)
  ! <t>/b/bad.templates: a template has no id
  ! <t>/b/bad.templates: a template id is not a string
  ! <t>/b/bad.templates: a template has an empty id
  ! <t>/b/bad.templates: "both" declares both text and from
  ! <t>/b/bad.templates: "neither" has neither text nor from
  ! <t>/b/bad.templates: "undeclared" uses {{athor}}, which it does not declare
  ! <t>/b/bad.templates: "empty-hole" has an empty {{}} placeholder
  ! <t>/b/bad.templates: "badfields": fields is not a list
  ! <t>/b/bad.templates: "nofieldname": a field has no name
  ! <t>/b/bad.templates: a template is not an object

== a file that is not one ==
templates: 0 from 0 file(s)
  ! <t>/c/broken.templates: not valid JSON
  ! <t>/c/future.templates: schema_version 99 is newer than this Studio reads
  ! <t>/c/nolist.templates: no templates
  ! <t>/c/notalist.templates: templates is not a list

== a search path whose directories mostly do not exist ==
templates: 2 from 1 file(s)
  greet {who*}
  plain
